      "main_description_html": "<h2 dir=\"auto\">RESULT</h2>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>option-1</li>\n</ul>\n<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"images/image-fdadc690-297f-4c00-9799-6373202ab1e0.png\"><img width=\"1254\" height=\"1254\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"images/image-fdadc690-297f-4c00-9799-6373202ab1e0.png\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; max-height: 1254px;; aspect-ratio: 1254 / 1254; background-color: var(--bgColor-muted); border-radius: 6px\" class=\"js-gh-image-fallback\"></a>\n<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"images/image-640453d3-c66a-40b2-aa6f-b3ae36d0c08b.png\"><img width=\"1254\" height=\"1254\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"images/image-640453d3-c66a-40b2-aa6f-b3ae36d0c08b.png\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; max-height: 1254px;; aspect-ratio: 1254 / 1254; background-color: var(--bgColor-muted); border-radius: 6px\" class=\"js-gh-image-fallback\"></a>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>option-2</li>\n</ul>\n<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"images/image-72183479-ae06-4362-9c10-59b4d3a1ded2.png\"><img width=\"1254\" height=\"1254\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"images/image-72183479-ae06-4362-9c10-59b4d3a1ded2.png\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; max-height: 1254px;; aspect-ratio: 1254 / 1254; background-color: var(--bgColor-muted); border-radius: 6px\" class=\"js-gh-image-fallback\"></a>\n<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"images/image-f82b8e98-6557-47a6-81fe-bcb5b477ba07.png\"><img width=\"1254\" height=\"1254\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"images/image-f82b8e98-6557-47a6-81fe-bcb5b477ba07.png\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; max-height: 1254px;; aspect-ratio: 1254 / 1254; background-color: var(--bgColor-muted); border-radius: 6px\" class=\"js-gh-image-fallback\"></a>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>option-3</li>\n</ul>\n<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"images/image-08b690cf-7740-4f8d-84da-a71d3dc2d40f.png\"><img width=\"1254\" height=\"1254\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"images/image-08b690cf-7740-4f8d-84da-a71d3dc2d40f.png\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; max-height: 1254px;; aspect-ratio: 1254 / 1254; background-color: var(--bgColor-muted); border-radius: 6px\" class=\"js-gh-image-fallback\"></a>\n<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"images/image-8fb8a022-45ab-429d-a4e0-6c9566139e0b.png\"><img width=\"1254\" height=\"1254\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"images/image-8fb8a022-45ab-429d-a4e0-6c9566139e0b.png\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; max-height: 1254px;; aspect-ratio: 1254 / 1254; background-color: var(--bgColor-muted); border-radius: 6px\" class=\"js-gh-image-fallback\"></a>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Summary</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Create the <strong>MapThru brand &amp; SEO/SSO asset kit</strong> — an original, copyright-free logo mark plus the full family of images the product needs for the landing page, SEO, PWA, social sharing, and the Google (SSO) sign-in flow.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Full spec (master data for <code class=\"notranslate\">ui-ux-pro-max</code> design skills):<br>\n<code class=\"notranslate\">docs/superpowers/brainstorming/2026-07-14-mapthru-brand-seo-sso-assets-brainstorming.md</code></p>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Background</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\">The landing page and login currently use a borrowed <code class=\"notranslate\">Building2</code> icon from a third-party icon set. This task replaces it with an <strong>original \"Plan Pin\" mark we own</strong> — a geometric map pin whose interior is a tiny floor plan (pin = a place on a map, floor plan = what's inside), in the app's primary blue (<code class=\"notranslate\">--primary</code> ≈ <code class=\"notranslate\">#4248ff<span class=\"ml-1 d-inline-block border circle color-border-subtle\" style=\"background-color: #4248ff; height: 8px; width: 8px;\"></span></code>), geometric-blueprint style. No layout, color, or font changes.</p>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Assets to produce</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Logo &amp; lockups</strong></p>\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Icon-only \"Plan Pin\" mark as SVG — detailed (≥40px) and simplified (≤32px) versions</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Horizontal lockup (mark + \"MapThru\" wordmark, matches header)</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Stacked lockup (for OG / login)</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> All four color variants: on-blue, all-white, blue-on-white, single-black</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Favicon &amp; PWA (SEO)</strong></p>\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> <code class=\"notranslate\">favicon.svg</code>, <code class=\"notranslate\">favicon.ico</code> (16/32/48)</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> <code class=\"notranslate\">apple-touch-icon.png</code> (180, solid blue)</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> PWA <code class=\"notranslate\">icon-192.png</code>, <code class=\"notranslate\">icon-512.png</code>, maskable 512</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Web app manifest (name/short name/theme color <code class=\"notranslate\">#4248ff<span class=\"ml-1 d-inline-block border circle color-border-subtle\" style=\"background-color: #4248ff; height: 8px; width: 8px;\"></span></code>)</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Social share (SEO)</strong></p>\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> <code class=\"notranslate\">public/og.png</code> 1200×630 — stacked lockup + tagline \"AI Indoor Mapping From 2D Floor Plans\" + 2D→3D visual on blueprint grid</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Twitter/X card (reuse <code class=\"notranslate\">og.png</code>, <code class=\"notranslate\">summary_large_image</code>)</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Google SSO / login</strong></p>\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Google OAuth consent-screen logo (120×120, square)</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Login/auth pages use the stacked lockup</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> \"Sign in with Google\" button uses Google's <strong>official</strong> branding, unchanged (no custom Google button)</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Spec sheet</strong></p>\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> One-page brand mini-sheet (variants, tokens/hex, clear space, min sizes, do/don't)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Compliance guardrails</h2>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Mark must be original geometry — do not trace or imitate a branded pin (e.g. Google Maps)</li>\n<li>No <code class=\"notranslate\">lucide</code> or third-party glyph used as the final logo (fine for ordinary UI icons)</li>\n<li>Floor-plan interior = generic rooms, not a real building's plan</li>\n<li>Google's sign-in button/G must use Google's official asset unchanged</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Out of scope</h2>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Landing-page redesign, font change, new primary color</li>\n<li>Full corporate identity program (business cards, letterhead)</li>\n<li>Animated/motion logo</li>\n<li>Wiring assets into <code class=\"notranslate\">layout.tsx</code> / manifest / metadata (follow-up dev task)</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Source spec: <code class=\"notranslate\">docs/superpowers/brainstorming/2026-07-14-mapthru-brand-seo-sso-assets-brainstorming.md</code> (branch <code class=\"notranslate\">product-docs</code>)</p>",
